    "h1": "When Roommates Take Sides in Your Relationship Arguments",
    "lede": "Navigating when roommates take sides in your relationship arguments requires practical emotional intelligence, clear communication, and grounded boundaries. Here is the definitive student guide to thriving on campus.",
