    "title": "Unpacking What Went Wrong: Conducting an Objective Relationship A",
    "description": "Complete guide to unpacking what went wrong: conducting an objective relationship audit. Master practical communication, campus boundaries, academic balance, and.",
    "kicker": "Second-Chance Dating & Closure Ethics",
    "h1": "Unpacking What Went Wrong: Conducting an Objective Relationship Audit",
    "lede": "Navigating unpacking what went wrong: conducting an objective relationship audit requires practical emotional intelligence, clear communication, and grounded boundaries. Here is the definitive student guide to thriving on campus.",
    "date": "2026-09-30",
    "ctaHeading": "Meet Verified Students on Your Campus",
    "ctaText": "Connect with ambitious, verified students across all faculties, halls of residence, and tertiary institutions on The College Date.",
