    "h1": "The Healing Timeline: How Long Does It Really Take to Get Over Love?",
    "lede": "Navigating the healing timeline: how long does it really take to get over love? requires practical emotional intelligence, clear communication, and grounded boundaries. Here is the definitive student guide to thriving on campus.",
    "date": "2026-09-30",
    "ctaHeading": "Meet Verified Students on Your Campus",
